Claude Code\:95a2\:9023\:30d7\:30ed\:30b8\:30a7\:30af\:30c8\:6982\:8981\n\n\
\:691c\:7d22\:7d50\:679c\:304b\:3089\:5f97\:3089\:308c\:305f\:4e3b\:8981\:306a\
\:60c5\:5831\:ff1a\n\n### \:4e3b\:8981\:306aClaude Code\:95a2\:9023\:30ea\
\:30dd\:30b8\:30c8\:30ea\n1. **anthropics/claude-code** - \nClaude Code is an \
agentic coding tool that lives in your terminal, understands your codebase, \
and helps you code faster by executing routine tasks, explaining complex \
code, and handling git workflows - all through natural language commands.\n\n\
\n2. **anthropics/claude-plugins-official** - \nOfficial, Anthropic-managed \
directory of high quality Claude Code Plugins.\n\n\n### \:4e00\:822c\:7684\
\:306aREADME.md\:306e\:8a18\:8f09\:30df\:30b9\:306e\:30d1\:30bf\:30fc\:30f3\n\
\:691c\:7d22\:7d50\:679c\:304b\:3089\:767a\:898b\:3055\:308c\:305f\:5178\:578b\
\:7684\:306a\:554f\:984c\:ff1a\n\n1. **\:30a4\:30f3\:30b9\:30c8\:30fc\:30eb\
\:624b\:9806\:306e\:554f\:984c**\n   - \nInstallation via npm is deprecated. \
Use one of the recommended methods below.\n\n\n2. **\:30c9\:30ad\:30e5\:30e1\
\:30f3\:30c8\:306e\:4e0d\:6574\:5408**\n   - \nThe attention budget (why less \
is more) Anthropic's official include/exclude table\n\n\n3. **\:8a2d\:5b9a\
\:30d5\:30a1\:30a4\:30eb\:306e\:8a18\:8f09\:30a8\:30e9\:30fc**\n   - \nThis \
documentation uses \"skills\" as the primary term, but you may see both used \
interchangeably. They both refer to markdown files in .claude/commands/ that \
you invoke with /skill-name.\n\n\n## \:63d0\:6848\:3055\:308c\:308b\:30a2\
